From 655c8107ac0a5a05b5990aecd640d5acbba6c030 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Andrei Otcheretianski <andrei.otcheretianski@intel.com>
Date: Tue, 26 Nov 2024 11:10:16 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] tests: Use global interface for P2P2 tests

These commands should be redirected to P2P device interace, thus use
global interface both for USD and pairing commands.

Signed-off-by: Andrei Otcheretianski <andrei.otcheretianski@intel.com>
